{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60c0bb840612a28ab890efd4390ae8e6e4f3c2e9cc8950d1948e8c22b039603e", "ja": "（響がデザインを監修した服が発売されることに\nなった。完成品が届いたので試着してみることに……）", "zh": "（响参与设计监修的服装要发售了。\n成品已经送到了，所以决定试穿一下……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "9ea9c8ae2685c3d647cfeae5cb19fe429c43ccf45184e11695089a00255e1e8c", "ja": "イメージどおり、かわいく仕上がったね！\n{$P$}、どう？", "zh": "和想象中一样，完成得很可爱呢！\n{$P$}，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1002_p", "source_sha256": "532add0f3676abed2a18fd3b998e45cf7ec367b29751e9721a42cd0cfc8df1f9", "ja": "ああ。よく似合ってるけど、なんだか新鮮だな。\nこういうガーリーなアプローチも、すごくいいよ。", "zh": "嗯。很适合你，不过感觉还挺新鲜的。\n这种少女风的设计也非常不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "70850cae98a8e5d3cffc2bdc13b29d93e992b02bae4940c3ebe09d5ed26a88d8", "ja": "ホント？　よかった♪　一から服を考えるなんて\n初めてだったけど……。", "zh": "真的？太好了♪虽然还是第一次从头开始设计服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "1ddcaac03d369ef8d2bcfb3ee1def965637cdb60ca4247f02045965490141906", "ja": "自分、カンペキだからね！　最後は、ちゃんと\nいい感じに仕上げられるって、自信あったんだ♪", "zh": "我可是完美的嘛！我一直有信心，最后一定能好好地做出很棒的效果♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1005_p", "source_sha256": "50c59cd046e5d7a5ffe75c105ed7e8e01cb089a5b160793798c2160d9ffd14a2", "ja": "おお～。さすが、響だな！　確かテーマは……\n『新しい自分に挑戦！』だったか。", "zh": "哦哦～不愧是响啊！我记得主题是……\n“挑战全新的自己！”来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "6e3275d287635b0619b4c064e8ea264424620bde902f05fa2b6584ebeb165169", "ja": "うん！　カンペキっていうなら、\nどんなジャンルの服も着こなせないと、ダメでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！要说完美的话，就得什么风格的衣服都能驾驭才行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "ffdf069bfad685d6706724d997e8b8da577d4de20187a87ca56a0dc8f3aaaa8c", "ja": "だから、あんまり着たことがない服にチャレンジして、\nカンペキ中のカンペキを目指そうと思ったんだ！", "zh": "所以，我想挑战一下自己不太穿的服装，努力达到完美中的完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1008_p", "source_sha256": "43d06020133393e422fc17da19d75ce212d82f4a61e230c029e3b6ad54c796a5", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nまさか、自分で新境地を開拓するとは……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n没想到你竟然会亲自开拓全新的领域……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "646692fd20db087e95ef646acc3f52575fe6bc6324c4557f733d85d18409bc96", "ja": "えへへ～♪　ポイントは、とってもカワイイとこだぞ！\nだから、絶対スカートで！ってお願いしたんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪ 重点就是要特别可爱哦！\n所以我拜托他们一定要做成裙子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "8a7dc7ccdb0d3cffc8b704702d21153d3ad55dbbfe80ea37d2b8901c2a3c7a1e", "ja": "それに、リボンやフリルも、いっぱいにして……。\n今の自分を見たら、ファンのみんなも驚くはずさー！", "zh": "而且还要加上好多缎带和褶边……  \n粉丝们看到现在的我，肯定会大吃一惊啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ba337547aacb42c50bd6a8faa206ded8c0e0004be3adcbd7d0ef0df439f8b9ab", "ja": "間違いなく、びっくりするな。\nみんな、響の姿に釘付けになると思う……絶対にっ！", "zh": "肯定会大吃一惊的。\n大家都会被响的模样牢牢吸引住……绝对会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "563270e5ac688cebbbe22cc73e2da524eaffd569d468d87aacb74e952c2fb866", "ja": "そ、そこまで言われると恥ずかしいぞ……。\nまあ、カワイイ自分もカンペキってことだよね♪", "zh": "被、被夸到这种程度，反而让人不好意思了……  \n不过，这也就是说，可爱的我同样很完美嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2261ca501fe3549eb0bf2ac1825e477fde2172f215d27a72a6fbb305455c5502", "ja": "もちろん！　……そんなわけで、\n響に新しいオファーがきてるんだ。", "zh": "当然！　……所以说，\n有新的通告找上响了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "eb736b29e0f8cebb938bbe4aead9575781fafad7655bd232b66adb89d9df8597", "ja": "……えっ、自分に？", "zh": "……诶，是找我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1015_p", "source_sha256": "62945aa756e877b6e17404f40d40d440c3f64e4f6e085d31ddf5b70e1408d2cd", "ja": "ああ。スムージーの有名店からなんだけど。沖縄産の\nフルーツを使った新作スムージーをPRしたいって。", "zh": "啊，是一家知名果昔店那边，说是想宣传一款使用冲绳产水果制作的新果昔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f07f435471148f18a5a2ec7f726e65a62a6f369ded1a1cf4f72a4cd87a4a09ed", "ja": "響にぴったりだと思うんだけど、どうだ？", "zh": "我觉得很适合响，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "f1f16eb44749fa801362dcd28ed62fa7455db8048b7264a6b396e6532d46d9da", "ja": "そ……そんなの、もちろんやるぞー！\nスムージーの宣伝とか、この服にも合いそうだしね。", "zh": "那……那种事，当然要做啦——！\n宣传冰沙之类的，感觉也很适合这身衣服呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9edc3ef3f558a5d5f0a0eaa759dc2efca39d46c428e2be606814f803a97a72c4", "ja": "ちなみに……シチュエーションのイメージは、\n『恋人とデート中』って話で……。", "zh": "顺带一提……这个情境的设定是，\n“正在和恋人约会”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "9b0b1c5d93c3441b914545fcf503588a08dbbd01e8da727573b32f0ad04d168b", "ja": "デデ、デート！？　うう、自分に、そういうのは……。\n……。", "zh": "约、约会！？呜呜，这种事对我来说……。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "4e144d4568fdf305cdbe7810f52bb1128948d029b5cb96190ab2244700848717", "ja": "……けど。『新しい自分に挑戦』だよね。\n{$P$}、そのお仕事やってみたい！", "zh": "……不过，这就是“挑战崭新的自己”吧。\n{$P$}，我想试试看那份工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1021_p", "source_sha256": "811c1fe87e3fdf15bb4b1ec2a0aa63b70940d55e3c665b7f449f7d714953430a", "ja": "そうか！　スムージーや服のアピールもだけど、\n響の可愛らしい魅力も、いっぱいアピールしよう！", "zh": "这样啊！除了宣传奶昔和服装，也要充分展现响可爱的魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0514_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "fc8cbcd89f497f8cf71ae1be87bb01b2f6f6a0f2f32d550d8ec21c0c7b2b7ecf", "ja": "うん！　みんなが、自分に夢中になるくらい……\nとびっきり、かわいくするさー♪", "zh": "嗯！要可爱到让大家都为我着迷……做到最可爱啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
